  Created     : 2026-09-20
  Description : Every piece of text the user reads.

  Why text is never written in a layout
                Android warns about text inside layouts for a reason.
                Text in one place can be fixed once. It can be checked for
                the same wording everywhere. It can be translated later
                without opening any screen.

                It also keeps the wording of business rules the same on
                every screen. That matters when the rule is the thing
                being explained.
  =========================================================================
-->
